==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|frm|inextricable}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|inextricabilis}}

===Adjective===
{{head|en|adjective}}

# {{lb|en|of a knot etc}} impossible to [[untie]] or [[disentangle]]
# {{lb|en|of a problem}} impossible to [[solve]]
# {{lb|en|of a maze etc}} impossible to [[escape]] from

